## Pythagorean Theorem

The theorem applies only to right triangles.

Students should first identify:

1. the right angle;
2. the hypotenuse;
3. the two legs.

Then apply the formula.

## Common Misconception

Students should not use the Pythagorean theorem on every triangle.

The triangle must be a right triangle.

