## Complete Sentence

A complete sentence must communicate a complete thought using the necessary grammatical structure.

## Fragment

A fragment is an incomplete sentence.

It may be missing:

- a subject;
- a complete predicate;
- a complete thought.

## Run-On

A run-on incorrectly joins complete sentences.

Students practice separating or correctly joining those ideas.

